---
description: Python service conventions
globs: services/**/*.py, packages/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
- FastAPI routers stay thin; logic in services/<name>/domain.py.
- Every tool/agent output is a Pydantic model from packages/rcm_models.
- Money is Decimal; never float.
- Write audit_event for every AI action; wrap high-risk actions in approvals.require().
- Tests in tests/<service>/ using tests/factories.py (synthetic only).
